  "_note": "PMax retail, feed + assets. merchant_id comes from the profile unless set here. listing_filter splits on custom_label_0 = top10 and EXCLUDES everything else; omit listing_filter to include the whole feed. final_url_expansion false = opted out. Images: local file paths (uploaded as image assets in a first request) or existing asset ids.",
